{"sourceLanguage":"en","strings":{"archived.threads.title":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archived Threads"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivierte Threads"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hilos archivados"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fils archivés"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アーカイブ済みスレッド"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"보관된 스레드"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zarchiwizowane wątki"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conversas arquivadas"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Архивные ветки"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Arşivlenmiş ileti dizileri"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Архівні гілки"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Luồng đã lưu trữ"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已归档的线程"}}}},"archived.threads.description":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restore or permanently delete archived threads."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Archivierte Threads wiederherstellen oder dauerhaft löschen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restaura o elimina permanentemente los hilos archivados."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restaurez ou supprimez définitivement les fils archivés."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アーカイブ済みスレッドを復元または完全に削除します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"보관된 스레드를 복원하거나 영구적으로 삭제합니다."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Przywracaj lub trwale usuwaj zarchiwizowane wątki."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Restaure ou exclua permanentemente conversas arquivadas."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Восстанавливайте или навсегда удаляйте архивные 